# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# --- AI Hujjat ---
# Built installers go to GitHub Releases, not into git.
/dist/

# Embedding model: too large for git (118 MB > GitHub's 100 MB limit).
# Fetch it with tool/download_model.ps1 (or .sh). The folder itself is kept via .gitkeep.
/assets/models/**/*.onnx
/assets/models/**/tokenizer.json

# Generated by tool scripts / local test runs
/installer/Output/
*.log
